OL,3,ACrypto giant Binance freezes $2.5bn of
OL,4,Aassets over suspected hack
OL,5,
OL,6,FZhao added that two other crypto
OL,7,Fplatforms, Tether and Circle, have also
OL,8,Ffrozen around $1.7bn in stolen assets.
